Description: Icinga Web SSO (patched build with OIDC redirect fix)
 Icinga Web SSO places a "Login with PROVIDER" button on the login page for
 each configured provider. Users are authenticated against the chosen provider
 and logged in to Icinga Web.
 .
 This is an unofficial drop-in rebuild of the upstream 1.0.0 package that adds
 the post-login redirect fix: after OIDC sign-in the user lands on the
 originally requested deep link instead of always the dashboard (external URLs
 rejected via the same check core LoginForm uses).
